lines+=sect(1,'Exact live preset','Discovered in `build/faculty-build-composer/composer.js`: **`stabilization-policy` — “AD-AS, Fiscal Policy & Stabilization.”** This single current quick start corresponds to the working audit label. Its actual selected IDs, library definitions, composer core, registry/manifest, graph registrations, mode readiness and Concept Review mappings were inspected before authorship. The canonical BEFORE snapshot, overlap mask, scope boundary and objective findings preceded production edits.')
lines+=sect(2,'Exact selected concepts and views','All 14 selections are direct; there are no derived views or source parents. The current runtime selection, not chapter filenames or sourceOccurrences, defines the inventory. Full question objects and all provenance/skill fields appear in both inventories.')
